-- Real menus for two NIT Hamirpur shops, imported from the CSVs in the CampusCart web prototype
-- (E-Commerce-Store/backend/data/menus). Generated; regenerate instead of editing by hand.
-- 123 products, 166 variants, 123 with a representative photo.
-- Prices are the shops' menu prices (no MRP on cooked food, so MRP = price). Veg status is only set
-- for items whose name says egg, chicken and so on; everything else stays unknown until shops confirm.

on conflict (name) do nothing;

on conflict (id) do nothing;

